{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"pangfa-e-p015a","title":"法正当箭劝刘备退","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-p015a-account","label":"裴注未标引书","text":"裴注记刘备与曹操争势不便不肯退，法正当箭于前，刘备遂与之俱退。","evidence":["pangfa-e-p015a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"受劝退军","evidence":["pangfa-e-p015a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0046","role":"当箭劝退","evidence":["pangfa-e-p015a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"先主与曹公争时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-p015a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-p015a-q","source_order":[37,192,"P015a"],"order":7003}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0046","name":"法正","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-e-p015a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-e052b936fc5c839af28c","layer":"pei","quote":"先主与曹公争，势有不便，宜退；而先主大怒，不肯退，无敢谏者。矢下如雨，正乃往当先主前。先主云：“孝直，避箭！”正曰：“明公亲当矢石，况小人乎？”先主乃曰：“孝直，吾与汝俱去。遂退。”","attribution":"裴注未标引书","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-31e2a5446b4054e32db6","start":3,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
